# Local-testing fallback for ai-foundation's secrets resolution.
#
# This file is only ever read when .aiconfig.json's
# secrets.allow_insecure_dotenv is explicitly set to true, and only as a
# fallback when no secrets.run wrapper (a real secrets manager, e.g.
# Bitwarden Secrets Manager's `bws run`) is configured or resolves a
# needed variable. It exists for local testing before a real secrets
# manager is wired up — never for production or CI use.
#
# Copy this file to `.env` (already gitignored) and fill in real values.
# Never commit `.env` itself.

AI_GIT_TOKEN=
